OL,3,GNEWSACloser radiotherapy call for
OL,4,Ahundreds of patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FA radiotherapy unit could save hundreds
OL,7,Fof cancer patients lengthy journeys, an
OL,8,FMP has said.
OL,10,FTim Farron, the Lib Dem representative
OL,11,Ffor Westmorland and Lonsdale, has
OL,12,Fwritten to NHS bosses asking them to
OL,13,Flook into providing the therapy in
OL,14,FKendal.
OL,16,FHe said currently, about 650 patients
OL,17,Ftravel from Cumbria to the Royal
OL,18,FPreston Hospital for the treatment - a
OL,19,Fjourney which takes an hour each way
OL,20,Ffrom Kendal and more for those based
OL,21,Ffurther away from the town.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
