OL,3,GNEWSACloser radiotherapy call for
OL,4,Ahundreds of patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire and South Cumbria Integrated
OL,7,FCare Board (ICB), which is taking over
OL,8,Fresponsibility for radiotherapy
OL,9,Fprovision from April, said it would be
OL,10,F"difficult to plan for" with "no
OL,11,Foperational capital currently
OL,12,Fidentified".
